					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 414110522,
					"content": "哈哈，別小看西風騎士團騎兵隊長的知識量哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						414110523
